@*
    HOME PAGE: application title, overview and navigation links
    (the three things the brief asks for).
*@
@page "/"

<PageTitle>University Explorer Portal</PageTitle>

@* ---------- Big welcome banner ---------- *@
<div class="p-5 mb-4 bg-light rounded-3 border">
    <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold">🎓 University Explorer Portal</h1>
    <p class="fs-5 col-md-9">
        Explore universities around the world and manage your university
        applications, all in one place.
    </p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="university-explorer">Start exploring</a>
</div>

@* ---------- Three cards linking to each area ---------- *@
@* row-cols-md-3 = 3 cards side by side on bigger screens, stacked on phones *@
<div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-3 g-4 mb-5">

    <div class="col">
        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">🌍 University Explorer</h5>
                <p class="card-text">
                    Choose a country to see its details and browse, search
                    and view its universities.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer bg-transparent border-0">
                <a href="university-explorer" class="btn btn-outline-primary">Open Explorer</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col">
        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">📋 Student Applications</h5>
                <p class="card-text">
                    View all submitted applications and edit existing ones.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer bg-transparent border-0">
                <a href="student-applications" class="btn btn-outline-primary">View Applications</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col">
        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">✏️ Create Application</h5>
                <p class="card-text">
                    Submit a new application to the university of your choice.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer bg-transparent border-0">
                <a href="student-applications/create" class="btn btn-outline-primary">Apply Now</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@* ---------- Short explanation of the APIs (shows the marker you understand the mashup) ---------- *@
<h4>How it works</h4>
<p>This portal is an <strong>API mashup</strong>: it combines data from several REST APIs into one experience.</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Countries API</strong>: country list, capital, region, population and flag</li>
    <li><strong>Universities API</strong>: universities for the selected country</li>
    <li><strong>Edutots Student Application API</strong>: create, view and update applications (GET, POST, PUT)</li>
</ul>